--Description: Demonstrate how to detect creatives whose “audience_selection_approach_info” shows
--             at least ONE actually‑used targeting signal (value NOT containing ‘UNUSED’).
--             Logic:
--               • LATERAL FLATTEN turns the JSON object into key/value rows.
